# session transfer artifacts
#
# A sandboxed development session with no network left a repository bundle and
# a rescued copy of a corrupted node_modules install in the working tree, and
# both were committed on 2026-08-24 before being removed again. Neither is a
# source artifact, and ignoring them keeps a repeat out of the next commit.
.claude-transfer/
.node_modules-corrupt-*/
